{"aliases":["嘉祥大師"],"authority_links":[{"id":"A000329","kind":"dila_authority","label":"DILA 人名規範","url":"https://authority.dila.edu.tw/person/search.php?aid=A000329"}],"avatar":null,"bio_en":"Jizang (549–623) studied under Falang at Xinghuang Monastery in Jiankang. He later taught at Jiaxiang Monastery in Kuaiji and at monasteries in Chang'an, becoming a leading exponent of the Sanlun tradition. His commentaries on the three Madhyamaka treatises and his Meaning of the Two Truths reject attachment to fixed philosophical positions. He also wrote on the Lotus, Vimalakīrti and Nirvāṇa sūtras.","bio_summary":"三論宗大師，闡龍樹中觀，明二諦與破邪顯正。","chronology":[],"dates":"549-623","doctrine_nodes":["二諦","八不中道"],"dynasty":"隋唐","lineages":[{"certainty":"influence","display_note":"三論宗以羅什譯三論為義學源頭，吉藏為後世弘闡者；前端應作 influence 讀。","edge_id":"sanlun--kumarajiva--jizang","evidence_refs":[{"claim":"義學承傳，非直接師承。","claim_scope":"influence","note":"三論宗以羅什譯三論為義學源頭，吉藏為後世弘闡者；前端應作 influence 讀。","ref":"CBETA T50n2059_002","source_id":"gaoseng-zhuan"},{"claim":"義學承傳，非直接師承。","claim_scope":"influence","note":"三論宗以羅什譯三論為義學源頭，吉藏為後世弘闡者；前端應作 influence 讀。","ref":"CBETA T50n2060_011","source_id":"xu-gaoseng-zhuan"},{"claim":"義學承傳，非直接師承。","claim_scope":"influence","note":"三論宗以羅什譯三論為義學源頭，吉藏為後世弘闡者；前端應作 influence 讀。","ref":"CBETA T49n2035_006","source_id":"fozu-tongji"},{"claim":"義學承傳，非直接師承。","claim_scope":"influence","note":"三論宗以羅什譯三論為義學源頭，吉藏為後世弘闡者；前端應作 influence 讀。","ref":"T50n2059/T50n2060/T49n2035","source_id":"cbeta-online"}],"from_master_id":"kumarajiva","lineage_id":"sanlun","note":"義學承傳，非直接師承。","relation_type":"influence","source_ref":"CBETA T50n2059_002、T50n2060_011、T49n2035_006","source_work":"高僧傳／續高僧傳／佛祖統紀","to_master_id":"jizang"},{"certainty":"documented","display_note":"本傳稱興皇道朗，依候選錄及 DILA A002918 規範為法朗；以本傳所載從學立師承。","edge_id":"sanlun--falang--jizang","evidence_refs":[{"claim":"《續高僧傳》吉藏傳記其七歲投興皇朗法師出家，從受義學。","claim_scope":"documented","note":"本傳稱興皇道朗，依候選錄及 DILA A002918 規範為法朗；以本傳所載從學立師承。","ref":"CBETA T50n2060_p